rso:Disclosure_Disclosure_Requirement_BP_1_General_basis_for_preparation_of_sustainability_statements a rso:Disclosure ;
    rso:belongsToTopic rso:Topic_ESRS_2 ;
    rso:originalText "Disclosure Requirement BP-1 – General basis for preparation of sustainability statements\\nAR 1. When describing to what extent the sustainability statement covers the undertaking’s upstream and downstream value chain (see ESRS 1 section 5.1 Reporting undertaking and value chain ), the undertaking may distinguish between:\\n(a) the extent to which its materiality assessment of impacts, risks and opportunities extends to its upstream and/or downstream value chain;\\n(b) the extent to which its policies, actions and targets extend to its value chain; and\\n(c) the extent to which it includes upstream and/or downstream value chain data when disclosing on metrics ."^^xsd:string ;
    rso:pageEnd 17 ;
    rso:pageStart 17 ;
    rso:sectionLabel "Disclosure Requirement BP-1 – General basis for preparation of sustainability statements"^^xsd:string ;
    rso:sourceDocument "ESRS_202_20Delegated-act-2023-5303-annex-1_en.pdf"^^xsd:string ;
    schema1:identifier "Disclosure Requirement BP-1 – General basis for preparation of sustainability statements"^^xsd:string ;
    schema1:name "Disclosure Requirement BP-1 – General basis for preparation of sustainability statements"^^xsd:string ;
    schema1:text "Disclosure Requirement BP-1 – General basis for preparation of sustainability statements\\nAR 1. When describing to what extent the sustainability statement covers the undertaking’s upstream and downstream value chain (see ESRS 1 section 5.1 Reporting undertaking and value chain ), the undertaking may distinguish between:\\n(a) the extent to which its materiality assessment of impacts, risks and opportunities extends to its upstream and/or downstream value chain;\\n(b) the extent to which its policies, actions and targets extend to its value chain; and\\n(c) the extent to which it includes upstream and/or downstream value chain data when disclosing on metrics ."^^xsd:string .

